{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/label_451.json","id":2355,"nhanesId":"","bundleName":"","fullName":"Whey Protein Chocolate","brandName":"Jay Robb","brandIpSymbol":"™","upcSku":"6 03907 00410 4","productVersionCode":"Not Present","pdf":"","thumbnail":"","servingsPerContainer":"11","hasOuterCarton":false,"percentDvFootnote":"Percent daily values are based on a 2,000-calorie diet. Your daily values may be higher or lower depending on your calorie needs. ","labelRelationships":[{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":2354},{"type":"Flavor difference","labelId":2356}],"contacts":[{"contactId":1410,"text":"Distributed by:","types":["Distributor"],"contactDetails":{"src":"01-raw/2025-09-25/data/contact_1.json","id":1410,"name":"Jay Robb ENTERPRISES Inc.","streetAddress":"","city":"Carlsbad","state":"CA","country":"","zipCode":"92011","phoneNumber":"1.877.JAY.ROBB","email":"","webAddress":"JayRobb.com"}}],"netContents":[{"order":1,"quantity":12,"unit":"oz.","display":"12 oz."},{"order":2,"quantity":340,"unit":"g","display":"340 g"}],"physicalState":{"langualCode":"E0162","langualCodeDescription":"Powder"},"servingSizes":[{"order":1,"minQuantity":30,"maxQuantity":30,"minDailyServings":1,"maxDailyServings":null,"unit":"Gram(s)","notes":"1 scoop","inSFB":true}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"productType":{"langualCode":"A1325","langualCodeDescription":"Other Combinations"},"statements":[{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"AMINO ACID PROFILE PER SERVING\nIsoleucine (Branched Chain Amino Acid)................................................1678 mg\nLeucine (Branched Chain Amino Acid....................................................2518 mg\nValine (Branched Chain Amino Acid).....................................................1458 mg\nAlanine...........................................................................................1214 mg\nArginine............................................................................................464 mg\nAspartamine...................................................................................2634 mg\nCystine.............................................................................................596 mg\nGlutamine. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . .. . . . . . .  . .4306 mg\nGlycine.............................................................................................398 mg\nHist idine. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . ..... 443 mg\nLysine.............................................................................................2297 mg\nMethionine.......................................................................................530 mg\nPhenylalanine..................................................................................706 mg\nProline............................................................................................1612 mg\nSerine.............................................................................................1259 mg\nThreonine.......................................................................................1789 mg\nTryptophan.......................................................................................443 mg\nTyrosine............................................................................................685 mg"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Made with **rBGH-free whey protein"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"* As the protein source\n**(See side panel)"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"• Outrageously delicious!\n• 25 grams protein per serving!\n• Easy to mix!\n• Made with stevia!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Chocolate"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"FOUNDED IN 1988"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Help Save the Planet!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"New Packaging to Help Save the Planet!\n“Thank you for helping us keep our environment clean and safe for future generations.”"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Our Mission Statement\nTo Produce the Best-Tasting Protein Powders on the Planet!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"PLEASE RECYCLE"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Provides all the essential and branched chain amino acids, plus other naturally occurring amino acids."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Whey Protein Recipes\nQuick Energy\n• 6 oz water, juice, or milk\n• 1 scoop Whey Protein\n• Shake, stir or blend, and enjoy!\nFat Burner\n• 12 oz pure water\n• 1-2 scoops Whey Protein\n• 8 frozen strawberries\n• 1 tbs raw almond butter (or 1 tbs flax seed oil)\n• Mix in blender for 30 seconds.\nPre-Workout Energizer\n• 8 oz pure water\n• 1 scoop Whey Protein\n• 1/2 banana\n• Mix in blender for 30 seconds.\nQuick Start\n• 1 cup fresh orange juice\n• 1 scoop Whey Protein\n• Shake, stir or blend, and enjoy!"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Offering Only the Best!\n**Since 1990, the Jay Robb Corporation has been producing what we feel are the best protein powders on the planet. To the best of our knowledge, we were the first company in the world to create a whey protein powder made from cows not treated with rBGH (a synthetic growth hormone).\nBecause rBGH-free whey is primarily obtained from small farms throughout the world, there is only a limited supply. The Jay Robb Corporation secures large quantities abroad each year to meet our growing needs; however, there are times when the world supply runs short. During these periods, we may choose to procure the highest quality domestic whey protein in conjunction with rBGH-free raw materials to produce our world-class whey protein.\nFor a FREE REPORT outlining what YOU can do, along with the Jay Robb Corporation, to help change industry standards so that ALL dairy products are rBGH-free and/or organic, please visit JayRobb.com.\nGod bless you!\nJay Robb(TM) \nClinical Nutritionist\nAuthor of The FRUIT FLUSH(TM)"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"THE BEST-TASTING PROTEIN ON THE PLANET(TM)"},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"(ALLERGEN INFORMATION) CONTAINS: Milk by-products (whey) and soy (lecithin). This product is manufactured in a facility that processes other products which may contain soy, dairy, wheat, tree nuts, shellfish, fish, peanuts and eggs."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Jay Robb Whey Protein contains NONE of the following ingredients:\n• NO MSG\n• NO Acesulfame-K\n• NO Artificial Flavors\n• NO Artificial Sweeteners\n• NO Artificial Colors\n• NO Aspartame\n• NO Sucralose"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"AWARD-WINNING FORMULA  FAT-FREE ALL NATURAL 100% WHEY ISOLATE"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"DO NOT USE IF OUTER SEAL IS DAMAGED OR MISSING."},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"SUGGESTED USE: Take one or more scoops daily to supplement your diet with additional protein. Mixes easily with water, milk, juice, or yogurt."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"KEEP OUT OF THE REACH OF CHILDREN."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration.  This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease."}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2011-11-25","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description